<title>UK: LIFFE coffee up, cocoa mixed, sugar may rise.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee up, cocoa mixed, sugar may rise.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Higher, stable after failing to make $70 up due. Sept</p>
<p>$29 higher at $1,879 at 1028 GMT</p>
<p>COCOA - Nearbys tightly mixed after unchanged open on Sept. Sept</p>
<p>one stg higher at 1,138.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Test of upside possible now fund selling appears</p>
<p>absorbed. August may test $325.00. August $1.20 up at $320.10.</p>
</text>
